IAttribute <|.. Attribute
IAttribute <|.. RuntimeAttribute
Attribute --> EAttributeRole
AttributeSet "1" *-- "many" AttributeSetElement
AttributeSetElement --> Attribute
AttributeSet ..> AttributeSystemComponent : Initialize
AttributeSystemComponent "1" *-- "many" CachedAttributeValue : one per IAttribute
CachedAttributeValue --> AttributeBlueprint
CachedAttributeValue ..> AttributeValue : Recompute
AttributeSystemComponent ..> SourcedModifiedAttributeValue : the four verbs take
AttributeSystemComponent ..> ChangeValue
AttributeSystemComponent ..> ImpactData : returns
AttributeSystemComponent *-- AttributeSystemCallbacks
AttributeSystemComponent "1" *-- "2" AttributeChangeMomentHandler : PreChange and PostChange
